### A3. Security & Authorization Foundation

#### [MODIFY] [middleware.ts](file:///c:/Users/USER/Accurate%20Medical%20Center/src/lib/api/middleware.ts)
- The file is only 8 lines (import statements). Need to implement the full `withApiHandler` / `withAuth` / `withRole` higher-order functions:
  - `withApiHandler` — catches AppError, Prisma errors, Zod errors, returns consistent responses
  - `withAuth(handler)` — wraps handler with session verification
  - `withRole(roles[], handler)` — wraps handler with role checking
  - `withBranch(handler)` — enforces branch-scoping on queries

